 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "$C_r$ fields",
 "statement": "Let $r\\geq0$. A field $K$ is *$C_r$* if every\nhomogeneous polynomial form $F\\in K[x_1,\\dots,x_N]$ of degree\n$d>0$ in $N>d^r$ variables has a nontrivial zero in $K^N$.",
